FILE: post_validator.py
PURPOSE: Validates converted JSON structure after conversion (NEW structure validation)
Includes comprehensive strict type validation for all fields

MAIN FUNCTION:
- validate_post_conversion(converted_json): Entry point returning (is_valid, errors_list)

VALIDATION FUNCTIONS:
- _validate_root_fields(data): Validates root level metadata fields with strict type checking
- _validate_content(content, number_of_parts): Validates content object structure with type conversion handling
- _validate_part(part, part_number, total_parts): Validates individual converted part with strict type checks

PART TYPE VALIDATORS:
- _validate_counting_part(part, part_number): Validates grid.rows, grid.columns (integers, strict type), correct_answer (integer, strict type)
- _validate_frq_part(part, part_number): Validates acceptable_answers array, ai_template_id (string, 12 digits, strict type)
- _validate_gap_part(part, part_number): Validates gap_keys array with value (string, strict type), display_order (integer, strict type), correct_order (integer, optional, strict type), correct_answer (string, strict type)
- _validate_input_part(part, part_number): Validates correct_answer object (strict type) with value (number, strict type), unit (string/null, strict type), constraints object with comprehensive type validation for all constraint fields (type, answer_format, boolean fields, integer fields, string fields)
- _validate_gmrq_part(part, part_number): Validates items object with A, B arrays, correct_answer object with A and B keys
- _validate_matching_part(part, part_number): Validates items object with A, B arrays, correct_answer array
- _validate_mcq_part(part, part_number): Validates choices array (strict type), each choice object with label (string, strict type), value (string, strict type), is_correct (boolean, strict type), correct_answer object (strict type) with label (string, strict type), value (string, strict type)
- _validate_mrq_part(part, part_number): Validates choices array (strict type), correct_answer array (strict type)
- _validate_opinion_part(part, part_number): Validates choices array (strict type), ensures NO correct_answer
- _validate_ordering_part(part, part_number): Validates direction (string, strict type, lowercase vertical/horizontal), items array (strict type), each item object with value (string, strict type), display_order (integer, strict type), correct_order (integer, strict type), correct_answer array (strict type)
- _validate_puzzle_part(part, part_number): Validates rows (integer, strict type), columns (integer, strict type), pieces array (strict type), each piece object with display_order (integer, strict type), correct_order (integer, strict type), src (string, strict type), alt (string, strict type), correct_answer object (strict type) with src (string, strict type), alt (string, strict type)
- _validate_string_part(part, part_number): Validates ai_template_id (string, strict type), acceptable_answers array (strict type) with each item string (strict type), optional guidelines array (strict type) with each guideline object containing student_answer (string, strict type), mark (number, strict type, 0 or 1), comment (string, strict type)

ROOT LEVEL VALIDATIONS:
- Required fields: question_id, language_code, language, country_code, country, subject, subject_id, grade, grade_id, number_of_parts, section_id, source, content
- question_id must be string (strict type check)
- parent_id must be null or string (strict type check)
- language_code must be valid and match language
- country_code must be valid and match country
- number_of_parts must be positive integer (strict type: integer not string like "1")
- subject must be string (strict type check)
- subject_id must be string (strict type check, required)
- grade must be string (strict type check)
- grade_id must be string (strict type check, required)
- section_id must be string (strict type check)
- source must be string (strict type check)

CONTENT VALIDATIONS:
- parts array required and non-empty
- statement required for multi-part (number_of_parts > 1)
- statement NOT allowed for single-part
- parts count must match number_of_parts (with type conversion handling for string/int mismatches)
- Each part: n, type, stem required
- Part number n must be integer (strict type) and must match position
- type must be string (strict type check)
- stem must be string (strict type check)
- explanation: optional string or null (strict type check if present)

TYPE VALIDATION FEATURES:
- All validations perform strict type checking (integer not string, boolean not string, etc.)
- Error messages include the actual type received (e.g., "must be an integer, got str")
- Catches type mismatches like "1" (string) vs 1 (integer), "true" (string) vs true (boolean)
- Comprehensive validation for input part constraints (20+ fields with proper type checking)
- Validates array elements individually (choices, items, pieces, etc.)
- Validates nested objects (correct_answer, constraints, answer_format, etc.)